# Jmix DTO Rules

## Scope
Applies to `src/main/java/**/dto/`

## DTO Pattern
```java
@JmixEntity(name = "UniqueNameDto")
public class UniqueNameDto {
    @JmixId
    @JmixGeneratedValue
    private UUID id;
    
    @InstanceName
    private String displayField;
    
    // Other fields, getters/setters
}
```

## Required Annotations
- `@JmixEntity(name = "...")` — unique name
- `@JmixId` on ID field
- `@InstanceName` on display field

## Creating DTOs
- Use `dataManager.create(Dto.class)` to instantiate
- Populate from queries or entity data

## After Creating DTO
- Add messages to `messages_en.properties`

## Forbidden
- JPA annotations (`@Entity`, `@Table`)
- Persisting DTOs to database
- Using DTOs as entity relationships
